   "widgets_values": [
    "ART STYLE (identical in every image): high-quality Japanese anime key-visual style adapted for a Korean webtoon. Thin, clean, dark lineart with delicate hand-drawn weight variation. Soft cel shading with smooth gradient shadows and a gentle bloom; warm golden key light from one side with a soft rim light on hair and shoulders; airy, slightly muted colors with natural skin tones; subtle paper grain texture over the whole image. IMAGE: background art for a Korean webtoon, an empty location with NO people, wide establishing view, eye level, detailed but clean, same soft anime illustration style and warm light as described, no text, no signs with readable letters, no logos. LOCATION: a Gangnam back street at night seen from across the road: the warm glowing window of a wine bistro, string lights, wet pavement reflecting light, parked bicycles.\n\nNobody in the foreground or middle ground: every table, seat and doorway near the camera is empty. At most tiny, blurred background figures, and only if the location text asks for them.",
